abstract: "Replication code and materials for a city-level study of electric vehicle charging facility expansion, recorded activity and operational policy responsibilities. MIT applies to original code; repository documentation, numeric figure sources, metadata, and saved statistical materials use CC BY 4.0; third-party materials retain their source terms. Manuscript source, author records, internal reviews, and restricted policy full text are not included in this release."
